Description: HuMMANet provides access to curated paired human
    microbiome-metabolome study bundles available in Bioconductor
    ExperimentHub. The package organizes matched sample metadata,
    species abundance profiles, original and harmonized metabolite
    profiles, and study-specific annotation resources including
    metabolite identifier mappings, microbial producer annotations,
    disease associations, pathway annotations, and drug similarity
    matches. HuMMANet is designed as a reusable Bioconductor data
    resource for consistent and reproducible cross-study microbiome-
    metabolome analyses.
